/*
 * Zilo UI copy (T05). Single source for the prototypes AND the copy table in docs/design/copy.md
 * (generated by design/prototypes/check/copy-table.cjs; the check fails if they drift).
 *
 * Fields:
 *   kind      detection-state | scan-state | error | tray
 *   surface   where it appears
 *   title     heading (sentence case, no trailing period)
 *   body      one or two sentences; {placeholders} are filled at runtime
 *   primary   primary action label ('' = none)
 *   secondary secondary action label ('' = none)
 *   announce  live-region politeness: polite | assertive | none (dialog titles are read on open)
 *   t10       contract status: "planned" = listed in T05, waiting for T10 to confirm the wire code
 *   notes     behaviour that the copy depends on
 *
 * Voice: plain, calm, second person. Say what happened and the next step. No blame, no jargon,
 * no raw codes in titles. Never say Zilo is "not installed": the SDK cannot know that (D-008).
 */
